    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n354" root="اخذ" body-key="A">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِخْذٌ</span></b>  [The <i>act of taking, taking with the hand,</i>
&amp;c.], a subst. from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَخَذَ</span>. (S, L, Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See
also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَخْذٌ</span>, in nine places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِخَاذٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4- 
Also <i>A mark made with a hot iron upon a camel's
side when a disease therein is feared.</i> (K.)

